# Generated harness probe and visual-comparison scratch output. Canonical
# result JSON and approved goldens remain visible/trackable outside these paths.
agent-proxy/probe-*.json
evidence/**/raw-probes/
evidence/harness-maturity/*/visual-regression*/actual/
evidence/harness-maturity/*/visual-regression*/diff/

# High-cardinality visual matrix attempts are reproducible scratch. Keep their
# result JSON trackable, while approved goldens and root-level evidence images
# remain visible to git.
evidence/harness-maturity/*/*visual*/**/*.png
evidence/harness-maturity/*/*compare*/**/*.png
evidence/harness-maturity/*/*generate*/**/*.png
evidence/harness-maturity/*/*golden-update*/**/*.png
evidence/harness-maturity/*/*regression*/**/*.png
evidence/harness-maturity/*/*-before*/**/*.png
evidence/harness-maturity/*/*-after*/**/*.png

# Accidental shell-fragment filenames (a historical cleanup commit tracked one).
/-
/[{]if*
